      "statement": "The head node runs earlyoom with an aggressive trigger (~2.49 GiB available) that can SIGTERM the vLLM worker or unrelated processes during a long-context prefill, so a recipe that serves short prompts can still be killed by a very long prompt and a quiet head is a precondition for long-context work.",
